{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)"},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}]},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}]},{"text":"Prerequisites","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Embed the Certificate","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Fetch a Session Token","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Perform a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST"},{"type":"text","text":" request to the following endpoint:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"i